# Paths where a human approval is required regardless of Claude's review.
#
# Claude reviews and approves ordinary PRs, but it must not be able to approve
# changes to the automation that governs it. Anything that could weaken the
# review gate itself is owned by a human.
#
# Requires "Require review from Code Owners" to be enabled on the branch rule.

/.github/workflows/   @bencan1a
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @bencan1a
/.github/rulesets/    @bencan1a
